      1  10000 ????						; ==============================================================================
      2  10000 ????						; PITFALL 3: THE LOSTER CAVERNS
      3  10000 ????						; An Atari 2600 Homebrew Game
      4  10000 ????						; Showcasing Advanced Graphics and Audio Techniques
      5  10000 ????						; ==============================================================================
      6  10000 ????						; (C) 2026 - A technical demonstration of the Atari 2600's capabilities
      7  10000 ????						;
      8  10000 ????						; Features:
      9  10000 ????						; - Advanced sprite multiplexing for 8+ simultaneous objects
     10  10000 ????						; - Multi-color sprite cycling for visual effects
     11  10000 ????						; - Asymmetric playfield for detailed cavern layouts
     12  10000 ????						; - 2-channel music composition
     13  10000 ????						; - Dynamic audio mixing
     14  10000 ????						; - Smooth screen transitions
     15  10000 ????						; - Color palette animation
     16  10000 ????						; ==============================================================================
     17  10000 ????
     18  10000 ????				       processor	6502
